    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to get <i>Higher Than Mush</i>, a stimulating, yet deeply chill<strong>,</strong> action roguelite platformer where every jump, dash, and decision counts! Dive into procedurally generated psychedelic worlds, built with stunning ray-traced visuals  and push your reflexes to the limit as you collect dopamine to ascend to Nirvana...or overdose trying!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychedelic Visual Feast:</strong> Immerse yourself in breathtaking, ray-traced environments, brought to life with the power of Unreal Engine 5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558350/extras/ad4a87f8d69146a85083c992f1277eea.poster.avif?t=1746763934\" width=480 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558350/extras/ad4a87f8d69146a85083c992f1277eea.webm?t=1746763934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558350/extras/ad4a87f8d69146a85083c992f1277eea.mp4?t=1746763934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience Chaos Destruction!\u00a0</strong>Everything you see can be shattered, crumbled, and blown to bits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558350/extras/2548eecf085bdf8991de8f83640efab4.poster.avif?t=1746763934\" width=480 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558350/extras/2548eecf085bdf8991de8f83640efab4.webm?t=1746763934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558350/extras/2548eecf085bdf8991de8f83640efab4.mp4?t=1746763934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill-Based Gameplay: Burn for Power, or Play It Safe?</strong> The brighter the Mush, the closer you are to overdosing, but the more powerful your dashes become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558350/extras/2946a5c4bad6d8b6892ad0698033c1b2.poster.avif?t=1746763934\" width=424 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558350/extras/2946a5c4bad6d8b6892ad0698033c1b2.webm?t=1746763934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558350/extras/2946a5c4bad6d8b6892ad0698033c1b2.mp4?t=1746763934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Levels: Endless Variety, Unpredictable Difficulty!</strong> Experience challenges that range from surprisingly forgiving to incredibly tough, with a unique level layout every time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558350/extras/3d1e372593c20d31844c9f2b580754db.poster.avif?t=1746763934\" width=424 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558350/extras/3d1e372593c20d31844c9f2b580754db.webm?t=1746763934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558350/extras/3d1e372593c20d31844c9f2b580754db.mp4?t=1746763934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prove Your Dominance: Are You the Ultimate &quot;Mush&quot; Master?</strong> Challenge players worldwide and climb to the top of the leaderboards!... or die trying!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558350/extras/1e333247fe09c83d804dce3ce38e8f93.poster.avif?t=1746763934\" width=424 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558350/extras/1e333247fe09c83d804dce3ce38e8f93.webm?t=1746763934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558350/extras/1e333247fe09c83d804dce3ce38e8f93.mp4?t=1746763934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
